 Was flagged here (see git history for the original entry) during the
 hero-stat rebalance discussion. Fixed as part of patch 0214's soft-cap
@@ -16670,3 +16852,71 @@ returns null). `node --check` on the modified `server.mjs` passes;
 `npx tsc --noEmit` on the game itself (untouched by this patch) still
 passes clean, confirming no collateral changes leaked outside the
